        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. Applications for subsequent sabbatical leaves after the first shall not be considered until all applications for a lesser number of sabbatical leaves have been considered. To be eligible for a subsequent leave, one must have seven (7) consecutive years of service subsequent to the previous sabbatical leave.",
