        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. Requirements During Sabbatical Leave - Each teacher of the School Board attending college on sabbatical leave shall be enrolled as a full-time student and shall pursue not less than the number of college semester hours required of the average student enrolled at such institution taking graduate work for an advanced degree. A record of all credits earned shall be filed with the Superintendent at the end of each grading period. The sabbatical leave for any recipient not successfully completing a course or with an incomplete grade, may be cancelled upon the recommendation of the Superintendent.",
